{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">屯門屯利街附近一帶再爆水管，是一個月內第四次，附近至少四個屋苑受影響。昨晚深夜開始停水維修，到早上陸續恢復食水供應。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER-0930_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026iEotvU2MI11787715563.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.WATER-0930_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事的是一條直徑600毫米的鋼水管，供應食水予顯發邨、怡峰園、恒順園和冠峰園等。水管昨日上午起出現滲漏，水務署昨晚11時後暫停食水供應，通宵進行維修，到早上7時半，陸續恢復供水。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER-0930_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20269C1QfMFNPC1787715570.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.WATER-0930_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">水務署指涉事水管曾有滲漏紀錄，署方爭取本月底在青山公路展開緊急水管鋪設工程，接駁至受影響的四個屋苑，以便日後如需要維修相關水管時可進行供水調度，確保食水供應不受影響。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T03:56:58.016469+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}